se model.', moduleId=47, description='ime to design the database model, taking into account all the necessary relationships to ensure our project functions correctly.', dateLimit=null, responsible=2, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=5, creation_ts=2025-04-05T15:01:31.953420-06:00, done=true, story_Points=5}, ToDoItem{id=94, title='Populate the database in OCI', moduleId=47, description=' Insert initial data into the database to enable integration with the project.', dateLimit=null, responsible=2, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=1, actualTime=2, creation_ts=2025-04-05T15:04:40.523605-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}, ToDoItem{id=93, title='Creation of the data base in OCI', moduleId=47, description='Design and implement the database schema with all necessary tables and relationships.', dateLimit=null, responsible=2, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=3, actualTime=4, creation_ts=2025-04-05T15:03:59.124405-06:00, done=true, story_Points=5}]}, Module{id=1, title='Oracle project', body='La primera versión del servicio debe de contener un Oracle Java Bot que automatice... \n1.2. Por temas de seguridad... \nEn la primera versión del servicio se solicita:\n○ El desarrollador pueda revisar sus tareas (To-do’s )\n○ El desarrollador pueda agregar/quitar una tarea (To-do’s )\n○ El manager puede ver las tareas de todo su equipo de desarrollo\n4. Manejo de Sprints / Features / Issues / Bugs\n5. Tasks con responsables tiempos estimados y tiempos reales\n6. Incluir capacitaciones individuales', categoryId=1, status=1, severity=2, startDate=2025-02-27, dateLimit=2025-03-15, parentModule=null, tasks=[ToDoItem{id=106, title='null', moduleId=1, description='Identify issues and improve system efficiency.', dateLimit=null, responsible=3, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=0, actualTime=2, creation_ts=2025-04-05T15:34:48.380708-06:00, done=true, story_Points=5}, ToDoItem{id=91, title='Task and responsibility administration for second and third period.', moduleId=1, description='Time to review every thing related to the project, create pending tasks and also make the second distribution of the responsibilities and tasks of the project.', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=3, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:56:33.220188-06:00, done=true, story_Points=5}]}, Module{id=22, title='Desarrollo del Login', body='Desarrollar la funcionalidad de login con autenticación de usuarios', categoryId=1, status=1, severity=2, startDate=2025-04-10, dateLimit=2025-04-17, parentModule=null, tasks=[]}]]
